+When an ACP client opts into `agentCapabilities._meta.commandUi` (`{ version: 1, protocol: "tsp" }`), it can drive the same interactive command UI over `_omp/ui/open`, `_omp/ui/event`, `_omp/ui/input`, `_omp/ui/command`, and `_omp/ui/close`. The TSP stream carries the actual terminal surfaces; ACP tool and permission requests remain on their standard channels.
+
 ## A harness worth keeping is one you _don't_ outgrow.
 
 Pick it up at **[omp.sh](https://omp.sh)**.
